WEBVTT

NOTE Paragraph timing uses generated clips; intra-paragraph timing is approximate.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Let's look at packages in Conficius, starting with how they're set up.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.121
This is the top of the package config. Default points

00:00:08.121 --> 00:00:11.641
to storefront, and work points to the API. Both use

00:00:11.641 --> 00:00:14.810
npm; the other managers are turned off further down.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:20.228
Once we open Conficius, the home screen brings package updates and security

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:24.580
checks together. Press p to see the profiles from that config.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:29.141
Default is active. Choose it, then open storefront from the scopes

00:00:29.141 --> 00:00:33.270
list. Each profile keeps its own projects and manager settings.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.897
Here are the dependencies, with requested, current, and latest

00:00:39.897 --> 00:00:43.594
versions side by side. The security results tell us

00:00:43.594 --> 00:00:46.470
there's more to check than updates alone.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:50.435
Open a package to see its versions and advisory evidence.

00:00:50.435 --> 00:00:54.390
We can scroll through the details without leaving the project.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:02.105
The vulnerabilities view puts the findings in one list. Open one

00:01:02.105 --> 00:01:06.690
for the affected package, severity, and where the information comes from.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:12.532
Further down, there's a description and references to read before deciding

00:01:12.532 --> 00:01:16.580
what to change. A newer version isn't the whole story.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.451
Now let's go back to profiles and choose work. This changes

00:01:23.451 --> 00:01:26.770
the project list, not just the label at the top.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.860
There's the API from our config. Open it, and

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:32.920
the path and results now belong to that project.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:37.657
These are the API's dependencies and security findings. We've checked

00:01:37.657 --> 00:01:41.920
two profiles and their projects without upgrading any packages.
